messages = PoolStringArray( "CHARACTER_LOCAL_ISAAC", "以撒", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_HARVESTING", "收获属性加成为125%", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_BUNNIES", "开局携带1个兔子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_D6", "开局携带1个六面骰", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_D6", "六面骰", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_D6", "每次商店刷新有{0}%概率使下次刷新免费。", "LOCAL_ISAAC_D6_FREE_REROLLS_EARNED", "获得的免费刷新次数：{0}次", "WEAPON_LOCAL_ISAAC_TEAR", "泪弹", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_TEAR", "开局携带1把泪弹", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_WIRE_COAT_HANGER", "铁丝衣架", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TRUMPET", "小号", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LUCKY_RABBIT_FOOT", "幸运兔脚", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CUPIDS_ARROW", "丘比特之箭", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BELT", "皮带", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_HOLY_WAFER", "圣饼", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_HOLY_WAFER", "受到的伤害减少{0}%。", "WEAPON_CLASS_LOCAL_ISAAC_TEARS", "眼泪", "WEAPON_CLASS_LOCAL_ISAAC_RANGED", "远程", "STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸弹", "CONSUMABLE_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB", "炸弹", "INFO_POS_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸弹库存：{0}。自动攻击500范围内的石头，每次消耗1个，造成固定100点基础爆炸伤害，爆炸范围受属性加成。", "INFO_NEG_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS", "炸弹库存不会低于0。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK", "石头", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCKS", "更多石头（+{0}）。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MR_BOMB", "炸弹先生", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MR_BOMB", "获得{0}个炸弹。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB_BOGO", "炸弹买一送一", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMB_BOGO", "所有掉落的炸弹变为每份{0}个炸弹。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_KNIFE", "妈刀", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_KNIFE", "所有武器累计攻击{0}次后，射出与携带武器数量相同的无限贯通妈刀，造成最高武器伤害{1}倍的伤害。最快每{2}秒触发一次。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_STARTING_BOMB", "开局携带{0}个炸弹", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK_BOTTOM", "谷底石", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ROCK_BOTTOM", "自身属性不会低于获得此道具后的历史最高值（炸弹除外）。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIGHT_CROWN", "光明王冠", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIGHT_CROWN", "满生命时，{2}+{0}%；本波受到伤害后，满生命加成变为+{1}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MONEY_EQUALS_POWER", "金钱=力量", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MONEY_EQUALS_POWER", "每持有{0}个材料，{2}+{1}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SOY_MILK", "豆奶", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SOY_MILK", "{1}+{0}%，造成的最终伤害×{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DOUBLE_VISION", "双重视力", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DOUBLE_VISION", "远程武器投射物+{0}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOBS_BRAIN", "鲍勃的脑子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BOBS_BRAIN", "生成一个鲍勃的脑子，接触敌人后爆炸造成{0}范围伤害，并使敌人中毒，每秒造成{1}伤害，持续{2}秒。{3}秒后复活。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_EIGHT_INCH_NAILS", "八寸钉", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_EIGHT_INCH_NAILS", "每把远程武器每次攻击有{0}%概率射出无限贯通的钉子，造成武器伤害。概率受{1}影响，每20{1}增加{3}%。\n远程武器击退+{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_IPECAC", "吐根酊", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_IPECAC", "每把武器每攻击{0}次触发一次爆炸：远程射出爆炸泪弹，近战命中时爆炸，造成武器基础伤害（{1}）的范围伤害，并使敌人中毒，每秒造成{2}伤害，持续{3}秒。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TOUGH_LOVE", "严厉的爱", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_TOUGH_LOVE", "每把武器每次攻击有{0}%概率造成{1}倍伤害（与暴击相乘）。概率受{2}影响，每10{2}增加{3}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_POLYPHEMUS", "巨人独眼", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_POLYPHEMUS", "{1}+{0}%，最终{3}×{2}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MILK", "牛奶", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SNACK", "小零食", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GHOST_BABY", "幽灵宝宝", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GHOST_BABY", "生成一个幽灵宝宝，射出无限贯通的幽灵泪弹，造成{0}伤害。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SISTER_MAGGY", "生成一个玛姬姐妹，射出泪弹造成{0}伤害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BROTHER_BOBBY", "波比兄弟", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SISTER_MAGGY", "玛姬姐妹", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAINBOW_BABY", "生成一个彩虹宝宝，随机射出燃烧、爆炸、中毒、普通或幽灵泪弹，分别造成{0}/{1}/{2}/{3}/{4}伤害。燃烧和中毒每秒造成{5}伤害，持续{6}秒。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BROTHER_BOBBY", "生成一个波比兄弟，射出泪弹造成{0}伤害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAINBOW_BABY", "彩虹宝宝", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_INCUBUS", "淫魔", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LITTLE_STEVEN", "生成一个史蒂文宝宝，射出泪弹造成{0}伤害，使敌人减速{2}%，可贯通{1}个敌人。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SUCCUBUS", "生成一个魅魔。在其光环内每{0}秒获得+{1}%{2}，持续至本波结束；离开光环后重新计时。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_INCUBUS", "生成一个淫魔，环绕玩家并以{0}%伤害复制当前伤害最高武器的攻击。未装备武器时使用紫色泪弹。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DEMON_BABY", "恶魔宝宝", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SERAPHIM", "生成一个撒拉弗，射出可贯通{1}个敌人的泪弹，造成{0}伤害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LITTLE_STEVEN", "史蒂文宝宝", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SUCCUBUS", "魅魔", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DEMON_BABY", "生成一个固定不动的恶魔宝宝，射出泪弹造成{0}伤害。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SERAPHIM", "撒拉弗", "EFFECT_LOCAL_LILITH_STARTING_PETS", "开局携带淫魔和好朋友一辈子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BEST_FRIENDS_FOREVER", "所有宠物造成的最终伤害×{0}，魅魔的光环加成×{0}。", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_LILITH", "莉莉丝", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BEST_FRIENDS_FOREVER", "好朋友一辈子", "EFFECT_LOCAL_LILITH_CHOOSE_PET", "初始可选择任意白色宠物道具", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_TAURUS", "金牛座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_TAURUS", "战斗中每秒获得+{0}%{3}，最多+{1}%。达到上限后无敌{2}秒，每波触发一次。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ARIES", "白羊座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ARIES", "每波{2}达到{0}%时，获得{1}次免伤。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CANCER", "巨蟹座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_CANCER", "每波生命首次低于50%后，本波受到的伤害减少{0}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LEO", "狮子座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LEO", "接触树木或石头时立即摧毁。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_VIRGO", "室女座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_VIRGO", "受到伤害后的无敌时间×{0}。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIBRA", "天秤座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LIBRA", "获得时，按{0}%{3}、{1}%{4}和{2}{5}的升级权重，均分这三项当前属性。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SCORPIO", "天蝎座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SAGITTARIUS", "人马座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_CAPRICORN", "摩羯座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_PISCES", "双鱼座", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_AQUARIUS", "宝瓶座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SCORPIO", "武器命中时使敌人中毒，每{2}秒造成{0}伤害，共{1}次。中毒可蔓延至附近{3}个敌人。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_AQUARIUS", "每{0}秒释放一次水波，推开范围内的敌人，并使其减速{1}%，持续{2}秒。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI", "双子座", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI", "每波随机选择一个已持有的自制宠物，复制{0}个，仅本波生效。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DRESSED_BOY", "盛装男孩", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DRESSED_BOY", "随机获得{0}点属性。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_RAW_MEAT", "生肉", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_EYESHADOW", "妈妈的眼影", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MOMS_EYESHADOW", "每次武器攻击有{0}%概率使敌人魅惑{1}秒。每{2}{5}增加{3}%概率，最高{4}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_LOST_CONTACT", "丢失的隐形眼镜", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_LOST_CONTACT", "每次武器攻击有{0}%概率消除本次弹丸或挥砍碰到的敌方弹幕。每{2}{5}增加{3}%概率，最高{4}%。", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_MAGIC_SCAB", "魔法血痂", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_ABADDON_BABY", "亚巴顿宝宝", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ABADDON_BABY", "生成一个亚巴顿宝宝，每{1}秒对周围敌人造成{0}范围伤害。", "LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI_CURRENT", "本波复制：{0}", "LOCAL_ISAAC_GEMINI_EMPTY", "没有可复制的自制宠物。", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_MAX_HP", "最大生命{0}%", "LOCAL_ISAAC_EYESHADOW_CHARMS", "魅惑敌人：{0}次", "LOCAL_ISAAC_PROJECTILES_CLEARED", "消除敌方弹幕：{0}个", "LOCAL_ISAAC_BOMBS_GAINED", "获得炸弹：{0}个", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_MAGDALENE", "抹大拉", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_CAIN", "该隐", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_BLUE_BABY", "小蓝人", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_JUDAS", "犹大", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_KEEPER", "店长", "CHARACTER_LOCAL_FORGOTTEN", "遗骸", "WEAPON_LOCAL_ISAAC_SPIRIT_SWORD", "英灵剑", "WEAPON_LOCA